  "instruction_type": "ferrata_lez_msg_wire::MsgMessage",
  "docs": [
    "Encrypted wallet-to-wallet messages on the Ferrata LEZ v0.4 test network (prototype, unaudited; docs/design/messages.md). Hand-written IDL in SPEL's format for the borsh interface of lez/msg-wire.",
    "One actor per account: (account, ferrata_msg); no PDAs. Owner instructions are sent by a transaction the account signs, straight to its own actor.",
    "The program stores envelopes it cannot read; the envelope format (X25519 or X25519 + ML-KEM-768, XChaCha20-Poly1305, padding buckets) is in docs/design/messages.md and deploy/testnet/web/msg/ferrata-msg.js.",
    "Refusals exit with one byte, 0xA1-0xB4 (errors); a refusal reverts the whole transaction and writes nothing."
  ],
